          "id": "P12",
          "description": "Keep changes cohesive by separating identity/deadline/group mechanisms, operation recovery, admission and health responsibilities, moving related helpers and tests with them. Update only affected process, execution-ownership, workflow, Skill/agent timeout, activity and CLI/API intent contracts. Run focused serial unit checks using cargo test --lib with filters for infrastructure::process, application::events, application::workers, application::workflow and application::agents::sessions; register and run the new daemon_lifetime_recovery integration target explicitly. Run relevant surface tests, formatting checks and git diff --check. Report exact commands, selected test counts, results and skips against the resulting candidate; do not promote source or restart the serving installation."
